// CodeRabbit generated shorthand and note-relative timing example.
song "A Friendly Conversation"
tempo around 108 bpm
length four bars
piano
    c4 for two beats
    e4 for one beat
    g4 for one beat
vibraphone
    volume -10 dB
    e5 at 50 percent of piano note one hold half a beat
    g5 after previous note hold half a beat
    c6 at end of piano note two minus half a beat

drums house
humanize all tracks
    timing ±3 ms
    velocity ±3 percent
